<section type="slide" position="1">
	<title></title>

	<content>
	<text>The SESAR programme is built up of sixteen work packages, which two work packages are relevant to the AIM domain?</text>

	<text>Four and Eight</text>

	<text>Eleven and Sixteen</text>

	<text>Three and Ten</text>

	<text>Eight and Fourteen</text>

	<text>Four and Fourteen</text>
</content>
</section>
<section type="slide" position="2">
	<title></title>

	<content>
	<text>What is the overall objective of System Wide Information Management (SWIM)?</text>

	<text>To provide information users with relevant and commonly understandable information of the right quality, provided at the right time and delivered to the right place, so enabling the concept of net-centric ATM operations</text>

	<text>To provide information users with relevant and commonly understandable information and enabling all to have access to aviation information</text>

	<text>Streamlining and volume reduction of unnecessary information to enable the provision of all global aviation information to users</text>
</content>
</section>
<section type="slide" position="3">
	<title></title>

	<content>
	<text>In what terms is data quality defined, according to ADQ?</text>

	<text>Accuracy, Traceability and Integrity</text>

	<text>Accuracy, Resolution and Integrity</text>

	<text>Timeliness, Integrity and Resolution</text>

	<text>Consistency, Timeliness and Accuracy</text>

	<text>Integrity, Timeliness and Completeness</text>
</content>
</section>
<section type="slide" position="4">
	<title></title>

	<content>
	<text>Which answer shows the areas of AIS to AIM supported by ADQ?</text>

	<text>Aeronautical Data Exchange/Agreements with Data Originators/Training/Digital NOTAM/WGS-84/Annex Differences/Adherence to AIRAC/Electronic AIP/AI Conceptual Model/Data Integrity Monitoring/Data Quality Monitoring/Aerodrome Mapping/Obstacles/Terrain</text>

	<text>Aeronautical Data Exchange/Aeronautical Information Briefing/Communications Network/Digital NOTAM/WGS-84/Annex Differences/Adherence to AIRAC/Electronic AIP/AI Conceptual Model/Data Integrity Monitoring/Data Quality </text>

	<text>Aeronautical Data Exchange/Aeronautical Information Briefing/Communications Network/Digital NOTAM/WGS-84/Annex Differences/Adherence to AIRAC/Electronic AIP/AI Conceptual model/Data integrity Monitoring/Data Quality monitoring/Aerodrome Mapping/Obstacles/Unique Identifiers</text>
</content>
</section>
