<section type="slide" position="8">
	<title></title>

	<content>
	<text>Which of these statements correctly defines the scope of ADQ?</text>

	<text>Eu-Reg. 73/2010 (ADQ) deals with all upstream data &amp; information handling activities (both systematic and procedural), from origination to publication</text>

	<text>Eu-Reg. 73/2010 (ADQ) deals with all downstream data &amp; information handling activities (both systematic and procedural), from publication through to end use</text>
</content>
</section>
